      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've noticed, that you can only grab one chain of bones at the same time of the same physbone component\nSo if i have 3 bonechains for my hair, all under a root bone that has the component on it I can only grab one chain simultaneously. If i want to be able to grab 2 at the same time, they need to be different components.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
