      "mergeID": "62265ba7d066a84bb762c8f5",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Currently when manipulating someone's bones you can also use one hand. So say they have a long tail you cannot grab another part of the tail and manipulate that part with the other hand. I would like to manipulate multiple grab bones with both my hands.",
