      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is particularly annoying since I've set up my avatar to have a root bone for redundant child bones (ears, hair...), so that I use less components for better performance. If I have one component for each ear, I can grab both of them.\nSo the issue is that one component can be grabbed once at a time.\nSince PhysBone seems to be able to tell it has multiple child bones, we should have the possibility to allow each child bone to be grabbed separately.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
