  "created": "2022-03-05T14:40:18.835Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you grab something with the left hand for example, and then you try to grab something else with the right hand, it will not work. Instead, your left thing will be released and stay stiff for a bit and now you will have nothing grabbed. \nI think it should be possible to use both hands to grab different stuff.\n\nEdit: Additional info from Portal_Jumper_79\n\" if two dynamic bones were part of the same hierarchy I could not grab more than one, but if they were different hierarchy I could. for example I can't grab to sections of my tail at a time, but I can grab both of my ears at a time\"",
